   - If a Licensee submits the Work for assessment (including allowed
     non-classmates), the submission must include this license text or a
     clear reference to it and the Author's name/contact.

5. Academic integrity representation
   - Licensee must not falsely represent that the Work or derivative is
     their original authorship. Any permitted submission by a Licensee
     must explicitly state the role of the Licensee (e.g., "modified
